      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بدّعهُ</span></b> , (S, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبْدِيعٌ</span>, (K,) <i>He attributed to him, imputed to him, charged him with,</i>
