<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِدْعَة</span>; expl. by <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَسَبَهُ إِلَى البِدْعَةِ</span> [which means
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَسَبَ إِلَيْهِ البِدْعَةَ</span>]. (S, K.)

